+# File Naming Standard
+
+## Purpose
+
+This document defines the naming conventions used throughout the ADE repository.
+
+Consistent naming improves navigation, automation, and long-term maintenance.
+
+---
+
+# General Rules
+
+- Use descriptive names.
+- Use underscores (`_`) between words.
+- Do not use spaces.
+- Do not use special characters.
+- Preserve file extensions.
+- Use stable document identifiers where applicable.
+
+---
+
+# Canonical Format
+
+PREFIX-ID_Descriptive_Name.md
+
+Examples:
+
+GOV-0001_Repository_Rules.md
+
+ARC-0001_Architecture_Map.md
+
+ADR-0001_Rename_Repository_to_Stewardship.md
+
+SPEC-0001_Document_Metadata.md
+
+---
+
+# Prefixes
+
+| Prefix | Meaning |
+|---------|---------|
+| GOV | Governance |
+| ARC | Architecture |
+| ADR | Architecture Decision Record |
+| SPEC | Specification |
+| PUB | Publication |
+| OBS | Observation |
+| RES | Research |
+
+---
+
+# Notes
+
+Document IDs never change.
+
+File names may change to improve clarity while preserving the Document ID.
