+# Repository Scripts
+
+## Purpose
+
+Repository scripts automate repetitive tasks while preserving repository standards.
+
+Scripts should reduce manual effort without replacing human judgment.
+
+---
+
+# Design Principles
+
+- One script, one responsibility.
+- Prefer composition over complexity.
+- Preserve repository standards.
+- Fail clearly.
+- Produce deterministic results whenever possible.
+
+---
+
+# Planned Scripts
+
+| Script | Purpose |
+|---------|---------|
+| new_document.py | Create a new repository document. |
