+
+Discussion Mode exists for exploration, hypothesis generation, architectural review, philosophy, brainstorming, and post-mission analysis.
+
+Discussion Mode SHALL NOT modify canonical repository state.
+
+All implementation work identified during Discussion Mode SHALL be queued.
+
+Transition into Discussion Mode requires:
+
+- mission completion,
+- explicit operator instruction,
+- or constitutional review.
+
+Transition out of Discussion Mode SHALL restore Execution Mode at the active mission.
