+Temporary engineering workspace.
+
+Contains
+
+Incoming.
+
+Current Batch.
+
+Scratch.
+
+Validation.
+
+Staging.
+
+Nothing here is permanent.
+
+---
+
+## 17_REPOSITORY_CONTROL
+
+Purpose
+
+Repository governance.
+
+Contains
+
+Authority Registry.
+
+Canonical Registry.
+
+Artifact Registry.
+
+Dependency Registry.
+
+Naming Registry.
+
+Promotion Registry.
+
+Lifecycle Registry.
+
+Eventually maintained automatically by the ingester.
+
+---
+
+# Canonical DE Documents
+
+Every enduring institutional domain SHALL possess exactly one authoritative document.
+
+DE - Institution.md
+
+DE - Project.md
+
+DE - Repository.md
+
+DE - Operations.md
+
+DE - Babbage.md
+
+DE - Ingestion.md
+
+DE - Systems.md
+
+DE - Memory Palace.md
+
+Those documents define institutional state.
+
+Conversations are evidence supporting them.
+
+---
+
+# Ownership
+
+The Difference Engine is the institutional authority.
+
+The repository is its institutional memory.
+
+Repository artifacts supersede conversational summaries.
+
+Conversations produce evidence.
+
+Evidence produces artifacts.
+
+Artifacts produce institutional knowledge.
+
+Institutional knowledge becomes executable capability.
+
+---
+
+# Current Program
+
+Current execution order is locked.
+
+1. Institutional Consolidation
+
+2. Repository Consolidation
+
+3. Ingestion Completion
+
+4. Operationalization
+
+No additional top-level domains shall be introduced until this roadmap is complete.
+
+---
+
+End of Document
