@@ -0,0 +1,139 @@
+# Repository Notation Standard v1.0
+
+Status: Canonical
+
+Purpose
+
+Eliminate ambiguity between directories, files, canonical documents, and placeholders.
+
+---
+
+## Directory
+
+Directories SHALL always terminate with a trailing slash.
+
+Example
+
+07_INGESTION/
+
+17_REPOSITORY_CONTROL/
+
+18_INBOX/
+
+---
+
+## Subdirectory
+
+Subdirectories SHALL also terminate with a trailing slash.
+
+Example
+
+07_INGESTION/
+├── Specifications/
+├── Parser/
+├── Validation/
+└── Testing/
+
+---
+
+## Canonical Document
+
+Canonical institutional documents SHALL always be represented as files.
+
+Example
+
+07_INGESTION/
+├── DE - Ingestion.md
+
+03_REPOSITORY/
+├── DE - Repository.md
+
+05_OFFICES/
+├── DE - Babbage.md
+
+---
+
+## Supporting Artifacts
+
+Supporting artifacts SHALL retain their file extensions.
+
+Example
+
+Parser_Development_Guide_v0.1.md
+
+SPEC-0001_Machine_State_Model.json
+
+Repository_Map.md
+
+---
+
+## Executables
+
+Executable artifacts SHALL retain their executable extensions.
+
+Example
+
+ingester.py
+
+build_graph.py
+
+validate_repository.py
+
+---
+
+## Archives
+
+Archives SHALL retain their archive extensions.
+
+Example
+
+Specifications.zip
+
+Governance.zip
+
+Parser.zip
+
+---
+
+## Tree Format
+
+Repository trees SHALL distinguish directories from files.
+
+Example
+
+DifferenceEngine/
+├── 03_REPOSITORY/
+│   ├── DE - Repository.md
+│   ├── Repository_Control/
+│   ├── Standards/
+│   └── Naming/
+│
+├── 07_INGESTION/
+│   ├── DE - Ingestion.md
+│   ├── Specifications/
+│   ├── Parser/
+│   └── Validation/
+│
+└── 18_INBOX/
+    ├── Incoming/
+    ├── Phone_Uploads/
+    ├── Zip_Archives/
+    └── Legacy_Repositories/
+
+---
+
+## Prohibited
+
+Directory names without trailing "/".
+
+Placeholder names that cannot be distinguished from directories.
+
+Repository diagrams requiring interpretation.
+
+---
+
+## Governing Principle
+
+Repository notation SHALL be mechanically interpretable.
+
+A repository diagram SHALL be directly translatable into an actual filesystem without human interpretation.
\ No newline at end of file
