-+# Contents
-+````markdown id="n6b4xu"
-+# Implementation Checklist
-+
-+**Version:** 0.1  
-+**Status:** Draft  
-+**Subsystem:** Repository Ingestion Framework
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Purpose
-+
-+The Implementation Checklist provides a measurable readiness assessment for the Repository Ingestion Framework.
-+
-+Unlike the roadmap, which describes phases, and the backlog, which describes work items, the checklist records implementation completion.
-+
-+It serves as the primary engineering readiness document.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Design Principles
-+
-+- Every item is objectively verifiable.
-+- Completion is binary.
-+- Evidence is required.
-+- Specifications drive implementation.
-+- Progress is measurable.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Completion States
-+
-+Each checklist item SHALL have one of the following states:
-+
-+- Not Started
-+- In Progress
-+- Complete
-+- Verified
-+- N/A
-+
-+Verification SHALL be performed independently whenever practical.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Foundation
-+
-+| Item | Status |
-+|-------|--------|
-+| Repository structure established | |
-+| AIS completed | |
-+| Core specifications completed | |
-+| Schemas completed | |
-+| Service contracts completed | |
-+| Glossary completed | |
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Artifact Intake
-+
-+| Item | Status |
-+|-------|--------|
-+| Artifact Intake Service implemented | |
-+| Artifact ID generation | |
-+| Metadata generation | |
-+| Provenance initialization | |
-+| Error handling | |
-+| Unit tests | |
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Structural Parsing
-+
-+| Item | Status |
-+|-------|--------|
-+| Markdown parser | |
-+| Conversation parser | |
-+| PDF parser | |
-+| Heading extraction | |
-+| Section extraction | |
-+| Code block extraction | |
-+| Table extraction | |
-+| Asset extraction | |
-+| Reference extraction | |
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Queue Generation
-+
-+| Item | Status |
-+|-------|--------|
-+| Queue candidate generation | |
-+| Decision queue | |
-+| Concept queue | |
-+| Tool queue | |
-+| Template queue | |
-+| Visualization queue | |
-+| Infrastructure queue | |
-+| Queue validation | |
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Validation
-+
-+| Item | Status |
