-+# Contents
-+````markdown
-+# Ingestion Report Schema
-+
-+**Version:** 0.1
-+**Status:** Draft
-+**Subsystem:** Repository Ingestion Framework
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Purpose
-+
-+The Ingestion Report Schema defines the standardized summary generated after every ingestion process.
-+
-+The report provides a human-readable record of what occurred during ingestion.
-+
-+It is informational.
-+
-+It is not the source of truth.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Design Principles
-+
-+- Every ingestion produces a report.
-+- Reports summarize.
-+- Reports never replace provenance.
-+- Reports are reproducible.
-+- Reports are human-readable.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Required Fields
-+
-+Every ingestion report SHALL contain:
-+
-+- Report ID
-+- Artifact ID
-+- Artifact Type
-+- Import Timestamp
-+- Parser Version
-+- Validation Result
-+- Overall Status
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Artifact Summary
-+
-+The report SHALL summarize:
-+
-+- Original Filename
-+- Source Platform
-+- Artifact Size
-+- Language
-+- Import Method
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Structural Summary
-+
-+The report SHALL include counts for:
-+
-+- Sections
-+- Paragraphs
-+- Conversation Turns
-+- Code Blocks
-+- Tables
-+- Lists
-+- Diagrams
-+- Attachments
-+- References
-+- Extracted Assets
-+
-+Unavailable metrics MAY be omitted.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Queue Summary
-+
-+The report SHALL summarize queue candidates generated.
-+
-+Example:
-+
-+- Decision Review
-+- Concept
-+- Observation
-+- Tool
-+- Template
-+- Visualization
-+- Infrastructure
-+- Cross Reference
-+- Open Question
-+- Constitutional
-+- Promotion
-+- Meta Improvement
-+
-+The report SHALL include counts only.
-+
-+Queue contents belong to queue records.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Validation Summary
-+
-+The report SHALL include:
-+
-+- Validation Result
-+- Warnings
-+- Errors
-+- Review Required
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Repository Mapping Summary
-+
-+The report SHALL summarize:
-+
-+- Existing Matches
-+- Related Artifacts
-+- Duplicate Candidates
-+- Merge Candidates
-+- Standalone Status
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Processing Timeline
-+
-+The report SHALL record:
-+
-+- Import Started
-+- Parsing Completed
-+- Validation Completed
-+- Mapping Completed
-+- Report Generated
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Output Summary
-+
-+The report SHALL identify:
-+
-+- Output Package Location
-+- Generated Files
-+- Generated Assets
-+- Generated Queue Candidates
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Recommendations
-+
-+The report MAY include operational recommendations such as:
-+
-+- Human Review Recommended
-+- Missing Metadata
-+- Unresolved References
-+- Unsupported Asset Types
-+
-+Recommendations SHALL NOT alter repository state.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Design Philosophy
-+
-+The ingestion report answers:
-+
-+"What happened?"
-+
-+It does not answer:
-+
-+"What should we do next?"
-+
-+Decision-making belongs to repository governance.
-+
-+---
-+
-+End of Specification.
-\ No newline at end of file
