-+# Output Package Specification
-+
-+**Version:** 0.1
-+**Status:** Draft
-+**Subsystem:** Repository Ingestion Framework
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Purpose
-+
-+The Output Package Specification defines the canonical directory structure produced by the ingestion pipeline.
-+
-+Every successful ingestion SHALL produce a complete, deterministic output package.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Design Principles
-+
-+- Consistent structure
-+- Predictable locations
-+- Complete provenance
-+- Immutable source preservation
-+- Extensible organization
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Standard Output Package
-+
-+artifact-id/
-+
-+├── source/
-+
-+│   └── original
-+
-+│
-+
-+├── metadata/
-+
-+│   └── artifact.yaml
-+
-+│
-+
-+├── structure/
-+
-+│   ├── chronology.md
-+
-+│   ├── sections.md
-+
-+│   ├── references.md
-+
-+│   ├── assets.md
-+
-+│   └── validation.md
-+
-+│
-+
-+├── queues/
-+
-+│   ├── decision_queue.md
-+
-+│   ├── concept_queue.md
-+
-+│   ├── observation_queue.md
-+
-+│   ├── tool_queue.md
-+
-+│   ├── template_queue.md
-+
-+│   ├── visualization_queue.md
-+
-+│   ├── infrastructure_queue.md
-+
-+│   ├── cross_reference_queue.md
-+
-+│   ├── constitutional_queue.md
-+
-+│   ├── promotion_queue.md
-+
-+│   └── meta_improvement_queue.md
-+
-+│
-+
-+├── provenance/
-+
-+│   └── trace.yaml
-+
-+│
-+
-+└── reports/
-+
-+    └── ingestion_report.md
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Required Components
-+
-+## source/
-+
-+Contains the original immutable artifact.
-+
-+---
-+
-+## metadata/
-+
-+Contains normalized metadata.
-+
-+---
-+
-+## structure/
-+
-+Contains structural observations only.
-+
-+---
-+
-+## queues/
-+
-+Contains generated queue candidates.
-+
-+---
-+
-+## provenance/
-+
-+Contains complete lineage information.
-+
-+---
-+
-+## reports/
-+
-+Contains human-readable processing reports.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Naming Rules
-+
-+Directories SHALL use lowercase.
-+
-+Files SHALL use snake_case where practical.
-+
-+Artifact identifiers SHALL be globally unique.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Extensibility
-+
-+Implementations MAY add additional directories.
-+
-+Required directories SHALL NOT be omitted.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Design Philosophy
-+
-+Every output package should be understandable by both humans and machines.
-+
-+Directory structure is part of the interface.
-+
-+---
-+
-+End of Specification.
-\ No newline at end of file
