-+# Provenance Specification
-+
-+**Version:** 0.1
-+**Status:** Draft
-+**Subsystem:** Repository Ingestion Framework
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Purpose
-+
-+The Provenance Specification defines how lineage, traceability, and evidence relationships are preserved throughout the ingestion lifecycle.
-+
-+Every derived object SHALL retain a verifiable chain of custody to its originating artifact.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Core Principles
-+
-+## Preserve Lineage
-+
-+No derived object exists without a parent artifact.
-+
-+---
-+
-+## Immutable Origins
-+
-+Original source material SHALL remain unchanged.
-+
-+---
-+
-+## Complete Traceability
-+
-+Every transformation SHALL record:
-+
-+- Source
-+- Destination
-+- Service
-+- Timestamp
-+- Version
-+
-+---
-+
-+## Transparent Derivation
-+
-+Derived artifacts SHALL document how they were produced.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Provenance Record
-+
-+Each provenance record SHALL contain:
-+
-+- Provenance ID
-+- Artifact ID
-+- Parent Artifact ID
-+- Source Location
-+- Import Method
-+- Service Name
-+- Service Version
-+- Processing Timestamp
-+- Repository Path
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Lineage Relationships
-+
-+Supported relationships include:
-+
-+- Imported From
-+- Derived From
-+- Extracted From
-+- Generated From
-+- Supersedes
-+- Superseded By
-+- References
-+- Related To
-+
-+Relationships SHALL be directional.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Transformation Events
-+
-+Each processing stage SHALL append a transformation event.
-+
-+A transformation event SHALL include:
-+
-+- Event ID
-+- Service
-+- Action
-+- Timestamp
-+- Inputs
-+- Outputs
-+
-+Transformation history SHALL be append-only.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Asset Provenance
-+
-+Assets inherit provenance from their parent artifact.
-+
-+Assets SHALL additionally record:
-+
-+- Asset ID
-+- Parent Artifact ID
-+- Asset Type
-+- Extraction Method
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Queue Provenance
-+
-+Queue candidates SHALL retain:
-+
-+- Originating Artifact
-+- Queue Assignment Method
-+- Assignment Timestamp
-+
-+Promotion SHALL preserve queue history.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Canonical Promotion
-+
-+Promotion SHALL record:
-+
-+- Source Artifact
-+- Reviewer
-+- Review Timestamp
-+- Destination
-+- Promotion Method
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Design Principles
-+
-+Evidence is permanent.
-+
-+Knowledge is derived.
-+
-+Derivation is documented.
-+
-+Nothing loses its history.
-+
-+---
-+
-+End of Specification.
-\ No newline at end of file
