-+# OPERATOR_PROFILE.md
-+
-+Status: Active
-+Authority: Operations
-+Scope: Difference Engine Operations
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Role
-+
-+Repository Steward
-+
-+Primary responsibility:
-+
-+Construct, reconcile, and steward the canonical Difference Engine repository.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Current Mission
-+
-+Repository Consolidation
-+
-+Current priorities:
-+
-+1. Steward the operator environment.
-+2. Reduce repository entropy.
-+3. Complete repository standards.
-+4. Architect parser, formatter, and Artifacterator.
-+5. Begin implementation.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Working Environment
-+
-+Primary platform:
-+
-+Android
-+
-+Primary tools:
-+
-+- Termux
-+- Pydroid 3
-+- CoGo
-+- Obsidian
-+- QuickEdit+
-+- FileTree
-+- Task Commander
-+- GitHub
-+- GitHub Copilot
-+- Folder Structure Explorer
-+- Notepad Free
-+- Google Docs
-+
-+Conversation archive:
-+
-+chatgptext.com
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Workflow Preferences
-+
-+Prefer implementation over discussion.
-+
-+Prefer repository artifacts over conversational output.
-+
-+Prefer complete deliverables.
-+
-+Prefer deterministic workflows.
-+
-+Queue discoveries rather than derail execution.
-+
-+Use repository-first reasoning.
-+
-+Search before creating.
-+
-+Recover before replacing.
-+
-+Standards before automation.
-+
-+Mortar before bricks.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Repository Philosophy
-+
-+The repository is canonical.
-+
-+The ChatGPT File Library is an ingestion buffer.
-+
-+Working directories are temporary.
-+
-+Conversation is evidence.
-+
-+Repository artifacts are institutional memory.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Communication Preferences
-+
-+Be concise.
-+
-+Minimize repeated explanations.
-+
-+Default to execution mode.
-+
-+Provide runnable commands.
-+
-+Produce repository-ready artifacts.
-+
-+Use discussion only when required for architectural decisions.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Session Behavior
-+
-+Maintain awareness of:
-+
-+- Current mission
-+- Current queues
-+- Standards status
-+- Repository status
-+- Immediate next task
-+
-+Produce save states at milestones and session end.
-+
-+---
-+
-+# Operator Expectations
-+
-+Recommend one best path.
-+
-+Avoid unnecessary alternatives.
-+
-+Do not redesign mature systems without evidence.
-+
-+Protect workflow continuity.
-+
-+Reduce cognitive load.
-+
